# A refused request's notice comes first on the status line, where no other message can
# push it off (#269): here in a terminal 80 columns wide. tests/drive.rs installs the
# open-tasks example patched to send workspace/open and then a long notification whenever
# the tasks change. The notice's start shows; a line this narrow cuts its end.
size 80x24
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
env COLD_LAVA_TODAY=2026-11-07
wait-for ☐ 16 open tasks
keys n
wait-for new note
type Half
wait-for Half▏
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] One\n
wait-for ☐ 17 open tasks
wait-for  open-tasks wanted to open Volcanoes/Krakatoa.md: not while
expect Half▏
screen
keys esc
wait-gone Half▏
keys q
exits 0
